{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1651769,\"title\":\"The Funeral\",\"tagline\":\"Grief was expected. Chaos was not.\",\"overview\":\"In a small Bulgarian village, two estranged sisters, Lina and Mila, reunite for their father’s funeral, only to find themselves caught in a whirlwind of absurd and comical misunderstandings. Accompanied by Lina’s foreign boyfriend, George, the family faces a series of chaotic events — swapped bodies, broken hearses, chicken chases, unexpected calls from beyond the grave, and heartfelt confessions. Amid the unfolding chaos, the sisters begin to mend their relationship, and Lina realizes just how important her roots truly are.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/it67ejkBGzp7pbXPLg66GyvtFHg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2025,\"runtime\":26,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"BG\",\"name\":\"Bulgaria\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Petya Maleshevska\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":5698039,\"name\":\"Petya Maleshevska\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1510175,\"name\":\"Elena Telbis\",\"character\":\"Lina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uc2HECpd7GmvHmvfmDQcrs8lohj.jpg\"},{\"id\":2798007,\"name\":\"Mila Bancheva\",\"character\":\"Mila\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/alh5UGxSFaX0MjQagW72xDuftzN.jpg\"},{\"id\":6071110,\"name\":\"Kuncho Kunev\",\"character\":\"Vlado\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6071111,\"name\":\"Borislav Popov\",\"character\":\"George\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pajJeIXmV3bKfSr5tRcwmW67kzZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1884933,\"name\":\"Dimitar Selenski\",\"character\":\"Ludmil\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jAd3LawbpvIctcFLZsrLY5oE1RG.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1084244,\"title\":\"Toy Story 5\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sfQtVlIHljToOwYjhe21KPGzZWK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qjTqY5co